<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Hanagumori"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="CHIAKI SATO"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Hanagumori - Single"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPB602301358"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1677276654"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Chiaki Sato</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">曾经我的眼里只有你</text><text for="L2">待那繁花盛开之际</text><text for="L3">将无法传达的心意悉心珍藏成束</text><text for="L4">若能放下多少过往</text><text for="L5">有朝一日便能展露多少笑颜吧</text><text for="L6">没有你的春天 又在悄然流转</text><text for="L7">迎着料峭寒风不禁瑟缩</text><text for="L8">只想早早赶回家去</text><text for="L9">打包一份快餐 两个人</text><text for="L10">只想钻进毛毯安然睡去</text><text for="L11">明明早已不再奢求你能明了</text><text for="L12">唯有记忆总在悄悄失约</text><text for="L13">常宽慰自己 到了明天一切都会好起来</text><text for="L14">阴沉的天空仿佛也在这样诉说</text><text for="L15">目光曾只追随着你一人</text><text for="L16">在那花枝初绽的岁时</text><text for="L17">无法传达的情愫细细束起成花</text><text for="L18">终究未能亲手交予你</text><text for="L19">自己便已悄然长大成人</text><text for="L20">没有你的春天 又一次轮回更迭</text><text for="L21">宛如错季绽放的花朵般的心绪</text><text for="L22">曾一直依依不舍无法割舍</text><text for="L23">可沉溺于伤感也早已令人厌倦</text><text for="L24">如今只想聆听温柔的轻声细语</text><text for="L25">若未曾与另一个他相遇</text><text for="L26">我或许仍深锁在旧日回忆里</text><text for="L27">连如何被爱都依然一无所知吧</text><text for="L28">其实彼此彼此呢</text><text for="L29">活下去的意义</text><text for="L30">本就是会随岁月改变的</text><text for="L31">伤口慢慢愈合的时光会给出答案</text><text for="L32">没能强装出一副</text><text for="L33">过得并不幸福的模样 真的对不起呢</text><text for="L34">你的侧脸正在记忆里渐渐朦胧淡去</text><text for="L35">若这飘零的花瓣</text><text for="L36">化作了蝶的双翼</text><text for="L37">真想任它翩然飞去</text><text for="L38">飞向某处遥远的天地</text><text for="L39">从前许下的那句诺言</text><text for="L40">至今仍念念不忘 真的很抱歉呢</text><text for="L41">春风卷携着漫天飘零的花瓣远去</text><text for="L42">从前眼里当真只有你</text><text for="L43">在那繁花盛开的时节</text><text for="L44">未及送达的情意早已聚敛成束</text><text for="L45">放下得越释怀</text><text for="L46">未来的某天便能笑得越坦然吧</text><text for="L47">没有你的春天 仍在四季里流转不息</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:57.467"><div begin="0:00.914" end="3:57.467"><p begin="0:00.914" end="0:03.204" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:00.914" end="0:01.024">あ</span><span begin="0:01.024" end="0:01.164">な</span><span begin="0:01.164" end="0:01.384">た</span><span begin="0:01.384" end="0:01.524">だ</span><span begin="0:01.524" end="0:01.764">け</span><span begin="0:01.764" end="0:01.894">を</span><span begin="0:01.894" end="0:02.354">見</span><span begin="0:02.354" end="0:02.814">て</span><span begin="0:02.814" end="0:03.204">た</span></p><p begin="0:03.644" end="0:05.984" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:03.644" end="0:03.774">あ</span><span begin="0:03.774" end="0:03.904">の</span><span begin="0:03.904" end="0:04.294">花</span><span begin="0:04.294" end="0:04.424">が</span><span begin="0:04.424" end="0:04.614">咲</span><span begin="0:04.614" end="0:05.064">く</span><span begin="0:05.064" end="0:05.984">頃</span></p><p begin="0:06.303" end="0:11.403" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:06.303" end="0:06.643">届</span><span begin="0:06.643" end="0:06.873">か</span><span begin="0:06.873" end="0:07.053">ぬ</span><span begin="0:07.053" end="0:07.443">想</span><span begin="0:07.443" end="0:07.933">い</span><span begin="0:07.933" end="0:08.123">を</span><span begin="0:08.343" end="0:09.013">育</span><span begin="0:09.013" end="0:09.353">て</span><span begin="0:09.353" end="0:09.713">て</span><span begin="0:09.713" end="0:10.593">束</span><span begin="0:10.593" end="0:10.983">ね</span><span begin="0:10.983" end="0:11.403">た<